{"synopsis":"Planet \\[Bumi] telah memasuki kondisi abnormal \\[Kiamat].\n\n– Kau telah gagal menyelamatkan Bumi. Sang Otoritas, \\[Jam Vintage (EX)], memutar ulang waktu dunia.\n\nBagi Yu Jitae, itu adalah pesan yang telah ia lihat berkali-kali.\n\nSungguh melelahkan.\n\nAkan lebih baik jika ia mati bersama yang lainnya.\n\nNamun ia tidak bisa, karena otoritasnya yang menjadikannya eksistensi terkuat, selalu membawanya kembali ke masa lalu setiap kali ia mati.\n\nDan bahkan dengan kekuatannya, ia tidak dapat melindungi bumi yang luas dari para naga yang mengamuk.\n\n– Waktu dunia akan segera dimulai.\n\nSaat jam kembali berdetak ke arah yang seharusnya, iterasi ke-7-nya pun dimulai.\n\nUntungnya, ia akhirnya mengerti inti ceritanya.","alternative_title":"드래곤을 유괴하다","author":"Choi Jin-Hyung, YUJU","artist":"Joo Hwangsae","chapters":[{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"15b81219-a691-4632-8def-a84584098d31","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"3b5d651a-92d9-42a4-a3de-fa896e2cad22","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"ef3d77b8-25eb-4811-a47e-4511d017cc84","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"85549b78-8196-44fa-a343-1c483945c473","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"76a2e181-5b77-42b1-8b58-f4b6c7585b5f","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"3e924589-2014-4523-b242-36e8c730544a","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"8f8b9379-eaa5-40af-9910-9c5e7c8993eb","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"078e6ca7-4f08-48b0-b73d-3c7039c98607","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"0c2f24d1-1ed1-45ef-9079-119b190cd1c9","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"b88d2c01-b447-4995-8d64-12458ae5865a","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"76ff4ef8-0eb0-4b8c-8e5a-7b7